    {
      "name": "set_participant_permission",
      "doc": "Change an EXISTING participant's permission level, up or down.\n\n`add_participant` cannot do this: it refuses a user who is already a\nparticipant. Levels live in `AccessControl`, whose grants merge\nlast-writer-wins, so a demotion converges like a promotion. The last\nadmin cannot step down.",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "user_id_str",
          "type": {
            "kind": "string"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "permission",
          "type": {
            "$ref": "PermissionLevel"
          }
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "kind": "unit"
      },
      "intent": "mutating"
    },
    {
      "name": "sign_document",
      "doc": "Record the CALLER's signature on a document.\n\nThe signer is the caller's ACCOUNT — a document is signed by a PERSON,\nand one signer on two machines must not read as two signatories — and on\nevery other node it is the signature entry's owner stamp. There is no\nsigner parameter.\n\nA signature is not a field value, it is a whole new PDF: the signer\ndownloads the current version, flattens their mark into it in the\nbrowser, uploads the result as a NEW blob, and records it here as a\nwrite-once [`SignedVersion`] from `base_hash` to `new_hash`. Nothing is\noverwritten: the uploaded document and every signature stay on record,\nand the document's current version is the last one in the chain.\n\n`base_hash` is the hash the signer actually had in front of them. If it\nis not the current version, somebody else signed in the meantime and\nthis PDF lacks their mark — refused, so the signer re-fetches and\nre-signs.\n\n⚠️ `pdf_blob_id_str` must name a blob THIS node holds. The announce below\nfails the whole call otherwise, with\n`blob operations not supported (NodeClient not available)` — a message\nabout the host, not about the blob, which reads like a misconfigured node.",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "document_id",
          "type": {
            "kind": "string"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "base_hash",
          "type": {
            "kind": "string"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "pdf_blob_id_str",
          "type": {
            "kind": "string"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "file_size",
          "type": {
            "kind": "u64"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "new_hash",
          "type": {
            "kind": "string"
          }
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "kind": "unit"
      },
      "intent": "mutating"
    },
